# ALLOWLIST. What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads to Cloud Build: only the files below.
# A denylist cannot know the name of every credential file somebody drops here (key.json,
# *-firebase-adminsdk-*.json, id_rsa, secrets.yaml, google-services.json, ...), so everything is
# ignored first and only what the image build needs is let back in. gcloud reads this file, not
# .dockerignore: keep the two in sync. Check with: gcloud meta list-files-for-upload
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!main.py
!auth.py
!quota.py
!reports.py
!llm.py
!prompts.py
